msgid "<b>Sidecar content filter</b><br>Python regular expression applied to the <i>content</i> of sidecar files.<br>Only files with at least one sidecar whose content matches are shown.<br>Files with no sidecar are always hidden when a filter is active.<br><tt>.*</tt> matches across line breaks (re.DOTALL).<br>Case-insensitive (re.IGNORECASE), including accented characters.<br>Leave empty to show all files."
msgstr "<b>Sidecar content filter</b><br>Python regular expression applied to the <i>content</i> of sidecar files.<br>Only files with at least one sidecar whose content matches are shown.<br>Files with no sidecar are always hidden when a filter is active.<br><tt>.*</tt> matches across line breaks (re.DOTALL).<br>Case-insensitive (re.IGNORECASE), including accented characters.<br>Leave empty to show all files."

